flowchart LR
    PR[Reviewed source change] --> CI[Static, test, contract, security gates]
    CI --> Build[Build once: Go, web, Flutter, native if any]
    Build --> Supply[SBOM + provenance + signature + release manifest]
    Supply --> Stage[Staging + migration + E2E + recovery evidence]
    Stage --> Approve{Risk-based approval}
    Approve -- Reject --> PR
    Approve -- Approve exact digests --> Canary[Progressive production / app pilot track]
    Canary --> Observe{Task, SLO, integrity, cost healthy?}
    Observe -- No --> Recover[Stop, disable, roll forward or compatible rollback]
    Observe -- Yes --> Complete[Complete rollout and handoff]

